            <ArticleTitle>New syntheses of (±)-tashiromine and (±)-epitashiromine via enaminone intermediates.</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>2609-2613</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <ELocationID EIdType="doi" ValidYN="Y">10.3762/bjoc.12.256</ELocationID>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>The syntheses of the naturally occurring indolizidine alkaloid (±)-tashiromine and its unnatural epimer (±)-epitashiromine are demonstrated through the use of enaminone chemistry. The impact of various electron-withdrawing substituents at the C-8 position of the indolizidine core on the preparation of the bicyclic system is described.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
